<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>The Middle Ages</title>
<style>
  *{box-sizing:border-box}
  html,body{margin:0;padding:0;background:#1d0619;color:#eee;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif}
  body{overflow-x:hidden}
  .page{width:100%;background:#1d0619}
  .scene{
    width:100%;
    min-height:1304px;
    height:1304px;
    position:relative;
    overflow:hidden;
    background:#1d0619;
  }
  .center{position:absolute;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%)}
  .logo{
    top:42px;
    width:205px;
    height:auto;
    object-fit:contain;
  }
  .intro-title{
    top:395px;
    text-align:center;
    color:#d9d1da;
    font-size:25px;
    line-height:1.7;
    width:360px;
  }
  .intro-title .author{
    font-size:17px;
    color:#b99cb9;
    margin-top:10px;
  }
  .intro-title a{color:#c34eaf;text-decoration:underline}
  .hero{
    top:558px;
    width:300px;
    height:130px;
    object-fit:cover;
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
  }
  .watch{
    bottom:20px;
    left:50%;
    transform:translateX(-50%);
    position:absolute;
    background:#080207;
    color:#eee;
    min-width:500px;
    text-align:center;
    padding:25px 35px;
    font-size:16px;
    box-shadow:0 0 25px #13000f;
  }
  .watch a{color:#d900b0;text-decoration:underline}
  .bubble{
    position:absolute;
    background:#fff;
    color:#342c39;
    border-radius:10px;
    padding:23px 30px;
    font-size:19px;
    line-height:1.35;
    min-width:300px;
    max-width:390px;
    box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.45);
    z-index:5;
  }
  .bubble:before{
    content:"";
    position:absolute;
    width:0;height:0;
    border-top:16px solid transparent;
    border-bottom:16px solid transparent;
  }
  .bubble.left:before{
    left:-17px;top:29px;border-right:18px solid #fff;
  }
  .bubble.right:before{
    right:-17px;top:29px;border-left:18px solid #fff;
  }
  .bubble.top:before{
    top:-17px;left:50%;border-left:12px solid transparent;border-right:12px solid transparent;border-bottom:18px solid #fff;
  }
  .bubble.bottom:before{
    bottom:-17px;left:50%;border-left:12px solid transparent;border-right:12px solid transparent;border-top:18px solid #fff;
  }
  .left-bubble{left:20px;top:570px}
  .right-bubble{left:calc(50% - 180px);top:575px}
  .answer-bubble{left:calc(50% - 180px);top:575px}
  .later-left{left:20px;top:875px}
  .scene-person{
    position:absolute;
    width:300px;
    height:155px;
    object-fit:cover;
    left:50%;
    transform:translateX(-50%);
    top:395px;
  }
  .scene-person.yellow{
    background:#ffe17b;
    box-shadow:0 0 0 1px #87652b;
  }
  .small-butterfly{
    position:absolute;
    width:28px;
    height:28px;
    left:59%;
    top:680px;
    color:#fff;
    font-size:24px;
  }
  .grid-wrap{
    position:absolute;
    top:42px;
    left:50%;
    transform:translateX(-50%);
    width:815px;
    text-align:center;
  }
  .class-grid{
    display:block;
    width:815px;
    height:auto;
    image-rendering:auto;
  }
  .grid-label{
    margin-top:12px;
    color:#e9dcea;
    font-size:25px;
    font-weight:bold;
    line-height:1.05;
  }
  .grid-label span{display:block;font-size:16px;font-weight:normal}
  .grid-bubble{
    left:20px;
    top:725px;
    max-width:320px;
  }
  .grid-bubble.centered{
    left:calc(50% - 245px);
    top:150px;
    max-width:305px;
  }
  .highlight{background:#ffe18a;color:#30231b;padding:0 3px}
  .stat-title{
    position:absolute;
    top:18px;
    left:50%;
    transform:translateX(-50%);
    text-align:center;
    color:#bbb0bd;
    font-size:19px;
    font-weight:bold;
  }
  .stat-title strong{
    display:block;
    margin-top:16px;
    color:#f5d75b;
    font-size:30px;
  }
  .yellow-grid{top:100px}
  .yellow-grid img{filter:none}
  .final-bubble{left:calc(50% - 115px);top:655px;max-width:330px}
  .bottom-bubble{left:20px;top:1245px}
  .btn{cursor:pointer}
  @media(max-width:1000px){
    .grid-wrap,.class-grid{width:70vw}
    .grid-wrap{left:50%}
    .hero,.scene-person{width:300px}
    .watch{min-width:70vw}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">

  <section class="scene" id="intro">
    <img class="center logo" src="__PLACEHOLDER_ASSETS_BASE_DIR__/059.svg" width="205" height="72" alt="The Pudding">
    <div class="center intro-title">
      <div>the middle ages</div>
      <div class="author">by <a class="btn" href="#grade">alvin chang</a></div>
    </div>
    <img class="center hero" src="__PLACEHOLDER_ASSETS_BASE_DIR__/065.png" width="300" height="130" alt="A student looking over a desk">
    <div class="watch">Don't like scrolling? <a class="btn" href="#grade">Watch the video instead!</a></div>
  </section>

  <section class="scene" id="grade">
    <img class="scene-person" src="__PLACEHOLDER_ASSETS_BASE_DIR__/065.png" width="300" height="155" alt="Student">
    <div class="bubble left left-bubble">Hey, what grade are you in?</div>
    <div class="bubble right answer-bubble">Fourth grade!</div>
    <div class="small-butterfly">🦋</div>
  </section>

  <section class="scene" id="meet">
    <img class="scene-person yellow" src="__PLACEHOLDER_ASSETS_BASE_DIR__/065.png" width="300" height="155" alt="Student">
    <div class="bubble left later-left"><span class="highlight">Yeah!</span> Wanna meet my classmates?</div>
    <div class="bubble left" style="top:1120px">I mean, I guess...</div>
    <div class="small-butterfly">🦋</div>
  </section>

  <section class="scene" id="classmates">
    <div class="grid-wrap">
      <img class="class-grid" src="__PLACEHOLDER_ASSETS_BASE_DIR__/066.png" width="815" height="1080" alt="A grid of classmates">
      <div class="grid-label">4th<span>Elementary</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="bubble left grid-bubble">Wow. Thanks, kid. Mind if I ask your class a question?</div>
    <div class="small-butterfly">🦋</div>
  </section>

  <section class="scene" id="question">
    <div class="grid-wrap">
      <img class="class-grid" src="__PLACEHOLDER_ASSETS_BASE_DIR__/066.png" width="815" height="1080" alt="A grid of classmates">
      <div class="grid-label">4th<span>Elementary</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="bubble top centered">Sure! But hurry up. Recess starts soon.</div>
    <div class="small-butterfly">🦋</div>
  </section>

  <section class="scene" id="belonging-question">
    <div class="grid-wrap">
      <img class="class-grid" src="__PLACEHOLDER_ASSETS_BASE_DIR__/066.png" width="815" height="1080" alt="A grid of classmates">
      <div class="grid-label">4th<span>Elementary</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="bubble left grid-bubble" style="top:350px">
      Who here feels like you <span class="highlight">belong at the school</span>?<br><br>
      So, like, feeling respected by other students and supported by adults?
    </div>
    <div class="small-butterfly">🦋</div>
  </section>

  <section class="scene" id="belonging-result">
    <div class="stat-title">Belonging<strong>9%</strong></div>
    <div class="grid-wrap yellow-grid">
      <img class="class-grid" src="__PLACEHOLDER_ASSETS_BASE_DIR__/067.png" width="815" height="1080" alt="Classmates highlighted in yellow">
      <div class="grid-label">4th<span>Elementary</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="bubble top centered" style="top:218px">
      Those of us in <span class="highlight">yellow</span> feel like we belong. Why do you ask?
    </div>
    <div class="small-butterfly">🦋</div>
  </section>

  <section class="scene" id="final">
    <div class="stat-title" style="color:#fff">Belonging<strong>73%</strong></div>
    <div class="grid-wrap yellow-grid">
      <img class="class-grid" src="__PLACEHOLDER_ASSETS_BASE_DIR__/067.png" width="815" height="1080" alt="Classmates highlighted in yellow">
      <div class="grid-label">4th<span>Elementary</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="bubble top final-bubble">
      Those of us in <span class="highlight">yellow</span> feel like we belong. Why do you ask?
    </div>
    <div class="bubble left bottom-bubble">
      Well, feeling like you belong is really important. It helps you feel safe, supported, and ready to learn.
    </div>
  </section>

</div>
<script>
  document.querySelectorAll('.btn').forEach(function(el){
    el.addEventListener('click',function(e){
      const target=el.getAttribute('href');
      if(target && target.startsWith('#')){
        e.preventDefault();
        document.querySelector(target).scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'});
      }
    });
  });
</script>
</body>
</html>
```
